# Modifier gitignore from https://github.com/iDoka/eda-scripts
## This project was developed in Vivado 2024.1 (hence the dir structure), but
## Only the verilog sources are really needed, as the design in this project
## is only being simulated and not implemented, so these should be the minimal
## files in order to add to EDA tool of choice

